Package: sprintML
Title: Rapid EDA, Baseline Models, and Submission Files for ML Competitions
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Varun", "Singhal", , "varunsinghal2006@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides quick exploratory data analysis reports, one-line
    cross-validated baseline classifiers (logistic regression, SVM, random
    forest), and helpers that generate correctly formatted submission files
    for binary classification hackathons and data science competitions.
